@startuml product-browse-activity
title 用户浏览首页与商品

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif"
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  DiamondBackgroundColor #F0F9FF
  DiamondBorderColor #3B82F6
  StartColor #16A34A
  EndColor #EF4444
  ArrowColor #475569
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  TitleBackgroundColor #E2E8F0
}

|用户|

start

:访问首页;

:进入商品详情页;

:选择规格;

|首页服务|

:聚合首页数据;

|商品服务|

:返回分类商品列表;

:返回商品详情;

:规格联动匹配;

|用户|

:浏览商品与规格;

stop

@enduml
